{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19603","headline":"赠毛仙翁 · 李程","name":"赠毛仙翁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"茫茫尘累愧腥膻，强把蜉蝣望列仙。\n闲指紫霄峯下路，却归白鹿洞中天。\n吹箫凤去经何代，茹玉方传得几年。\n他日更来人世看，又应东海变桑田。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李程","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19603.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19603","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}